# Validation/pilot service logs. These are generated by running the API or
# frontend locally against a real database, so they capture SQL statements
# (app/core/database.py sets echo=settings.debug) and therefore customer
# messages, vehicle descriptions, and PII. They are evidence, not source.
*.log
